                        "entry_id": "6839576b-e14a-35ca-ba55-c4140bea4829",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Suffering from plethora; ruddy in complexion, congested or swollen with blood."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fd1fce3-15cf-4400-a0ef-ec94b4e6d57e",
                                "sense_id": "5a577fb8-bf2b-357f-a7c2-7363a26b16b4",
                                "text": "a horse-leech, whose deep maw\nThe plethoric King Swellfoot could not fill,\nAnd who, till full, will cling for ever."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "549c5211-d3b5-4403-8869-08fdfed69065",
                                "sense_id": "5a577fb8-bf2b-357f-a7c2-7363a26b16b4",
                                "text": "If the predisposition to the disease has arisen from a plethoric state of the system, or from a turgescence in the vessels of the head, this is to be obviated by bleeding, both generally and topically, but more particularly the latter; an abstemious diet and proper exercise; and by a seton in the neck."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d217c4e-17d0-4f43-8b8c-c0924bf15b4c",
                                "sense_id": "5a577fb8-bf2b-357f-a7c2-7363a26b16b4",
                                "text": "Harold Atkinson, her host, was a fine handsome grey-haired man, plethoric and somewhat corpulent, with an eye for a pretty woman […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a8ea2317-555f-3287-b06b-2f2c6dc10acc",
                        "entry_id": "6839576b-e14a-35ca-ba55-c4140bea4829",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Excessive, overabundant, rife; loosely, abundant, varied."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f5eb1aa-9e27-44bc-bae9-f65cfb74ab21",
                                "sense_id": "a8ea2317-555f-3287-b06b-2f2c6dc10acc",
                                "text": "the judges [...] were arranging their robes and coughing into their fists, the ebb and flow of their plethoric wigs like a flock of sheep on the run."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1421c23b-5a4e-3cf5-b86a-86ca6ae5bb94",
                        "entry_id": "6839576b-e14a-35ca-ba55-c4140bea4829",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Full or excessively full."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1bada80-ea2c-4ec8-af58-e78864c647ea",
                                "sense_id": "1421c23b-5a4e-3cf5-b86a-86ca6ae5bb94",
                                "text": "Behold the Mansion reared by Dædal Jack!\nSee the Malt stored in many a plethoric sack,\nIn the proud cirque of Juan's bivouac!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
